{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Collapse Of The Midnight Sun&quot;</strong> is a cozy indie game with metroidvania and time loop mechanics that is less than one hour long and developed from scratch by a single developer. You'll be exploring an island that used to be a mountain before the city next to it flooded. The human made fusion reaction that lights up the sky as if it was the <i>sun</i>, has started to collapse. You only have a couple of minutes before it does and time resets. During these couple of minutes, you'll explore  the island and\u00a0memorize its locations like\u00a0<i>the abandoned</i> <i>train station</i> and tools like\u00a0<i>the lantern.</i> Memorizing these will be crucial for solving the puzzles ahead, before the next collapse and the resulting time loop.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736860?t=1751005848","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736860?t=1751005848","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736860/94bae375c07d1daab82a9fbe01c7287264fa30dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751005848","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736860/94bae375c07d1daab82a9fbe01c7287264fa30dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751005848","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Collapse Of The Midnight Sun&quot;</strong> is a cozy indie game with metroidvania and time loop mechanics that is less than one hour long and developed from scratch by a single developer. You'll be exploring an island that used to be a mountain before the city next to it flooded. The human made fusion reaction that lights up the sky as if it was the <i>sun</i>, has started to collapse. You only have a couple of minutes before it does and time resets. During these couple of minutes, you'll explore  the island and\u00a0memorize its locations like\u00a0<i>the abandoned</i> <i>train station</i> and tools like\u00a0<i>the lantern.</i> Memorizing these will be crucial for solving the puzzles ahead, before the next collapse and the resulting time loop.</p>","developers":["fosa.lu","Fournelle Sam"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736860/53e6feab5f57eb915301eb2138a51b0ca0565fee/header.jpg?t=1751005848","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Debian 8 or equivalent Distro<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or equivalent</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Debian 12 or equivalent Distro<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Six Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1080 or equivalent</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736860/1590460657/ff4af32b4bf6fa394f5955d0fa6ff008f6e7ea25/1750431115/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748526886","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736860/1590460657/ff4af32b4bf6fa394f5955d0fa6ff008f6e7ea25/1750431115/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748526886","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstati